;;; EXERCISE

#|
Creating a homophonic score for string quartet.

1. Make 8 chords of 4 pitches with a ringmodulation.
Using 4 pitches as carriers (pitch-list) and 4 as
modulators (see the documentation of [ring-modulation].

2. Distribute them from high to low (vn1 to vc) using
[matrix-transpose] (see documentation for Distribution
in Chapter Assembling)

3. Make a score with homophonic chords in random lengths
|#

